  ("p","Most of our candidate relationships started on BizOps and strategy searches, so we usually know the market before the intake call ends. We confirm scope, comp and location with you, talk to every candidate ourselves, and send a short list with a plain read on each person's strengths and risks. Fees are paid by the company. Candidates never pay."),
